        "description": "Add your first meteo station. You can add more stations later from the integration page. Station IDs are the numbers used by the A-Ster network (for example 428). To find the ID, open your station page on the A-Ster portal (e.g. view2.php?u=Ręczno), press F12 -> Network and look for the request data2.php?s=422 - the number after s= is the ID.",
